<title>SINGAPORE: China's Maoming refinery cuts output by 10-15 pct.</title>
<headline>China's Maoming refinery cuts output by 10-15 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>China's state-owned Maoming Petrochemical Corp has cut runs at its 170,0000 barrels-per-day (bpd) refinery since mid July by 10-15 percent, sources familiar with the refinery said on Wednesday.</p>
</text>
